eliability without requiring game-specific adjustments or configurations.\n\nKey features of ESP Players by ItzXery include:\n\n1. **Player Highlighting:** Clearly marks all players with customizable boxes, outlines, or highlights, allowing you to easily distinguish each character from the environment.\n\n2. **Health and Name Display:** Shows the health status and username of each player in real-time, providing valuable information for strategic decisions during gameplay.\n\n3. **Universal Compatibility:** Designed to work in virtually any Roblox game regardless of map or server, without relying on Game IDs or game-specific scripts.\n\n4. **Performance Optimized:** Lightweight and efficient, ensuring that ESP visualizations do not cause frame drops or negatively affect overall game performance.\n\n5. **Customizable Visuals:** Users can adjust colors, box styles, and distances for the ESP, allowing personalization according to preferences and visual clarity.\n\n6. **Safe and Stable:** Wrapped in safe execution functions to prevent errors in games with varying object structures, ensuring smooth operation across multiple game environments.\n\n7. **Quick Activation:** Easy to run via loadstring or executor, requiring minimal setup while providing instant visual enhancement for situational awareness.\n\nESP Players by ItzXery is ideal for Roblox players who want enhanced visibility of other characters without compromising performance or stability. This script is fully universal, highly reliable, and provides a professional-grade ESP solution for a better gaming experience.","tags":["Universal Scripts Esp Players ItzXery"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6894491ee73feb40aebab9bb","username":"UserID","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7f73b1649d5695976c6ee582266b3638e908a5639322619be3f8377f9474067e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6894491ee73feb40aebab9bb-1763097973602.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6894491ee73f